# Local iteration datasets. Only the HOLDOUT dataset is committed (deployment.md
# §5.4) — it is what the deployed API seeds itself from and what the reported
# numbers are measured against. A DEV_SEED dataset is regenerable in one command
# (`npm run generate -- dev`) and would otherwise churn on every generator change.
